        <mxCell id="note" value="⚠️ The web pod is NOT in the realtime path.&#xa;GraphQL subscriptions (3) and socket.io (4) go edge → backend directly.&#xa;web/server/web.ts:84 proxies HTTP /graphql only (no ws:true / upgrade handler)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
